  hsa:problem <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/problem/weekend-gap> ;
  skos:editorialNote "The wiki item says 'limit social jet lag'. The one-hour figure in the plain line is Huberman's and is unverified; see also myth M2. Plain line corrected after the literature search: NSF 2023 says catch-up sleep 'may be beneficial' when weekday sleep is short; no source supports the one-hour rule."@en .

