  hsa:timeOfDay <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/timeOfDay/bedtime> ;
  hsa:condition <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/condition/general> ;
  skos:definition "Wear loose, breathable socks or place a hot water bottle near your feet to keep them warm without overheating."@en ;
  skos:editorialNote "Pulls the opposite way from cooling tips (1.2.1, frozen water bottle); the wiki says warm feet help the body shed heat. Write-up has no citations."@en .

