  hsa:timeOfDay <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/timeOfDay/evening> ;
  hsa:condition <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/facet/condition/general> ;
  skos:definition "Eat one kiwi or a small serving of tart cherry juice about an hour before bed to naturally boost melatonin and improve sleep quality."@en ;
  skos:editorialNote "Plain line hedged because the wiki write-up cites no studies and its classification table rates evidence 'limited'. Availability and cost vary by region."@en .

<https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/small-snack-before-bed> a skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/> ;
