<https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/bed-partner-snoring> a skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <https://health-culture.org/sleep-advice/> ;
  skos:prefLabel "Sharing a bed is fine for most couples; if a partner's snoring wakes you, get the snoring checked or try separate beds."@en ;
